{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14107070","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14107070","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1410707001:1":{"text":"真的在这里！杜恩加尔……是杜恩加尔！","source_cn":"真的在这里！杜恩加尔……是杜恩加尔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5078E2B9965FE66C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1410707002:1":{"text":"弗林！这可恶的小老头……怪不得他对复活赫托信心十足……他竟然找到了杜恩加尔！","source_cn":"弗林！这可恶的小老头……怪不得他对复活赫托信心十足……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9316B843EA2F8620","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410707003:1":{"text":"你冷静下来仔细看看，我怀疑只是个仿品。","source_cn":"你冷静下来仔细看看，我怀疑只是个仿品。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54812E3F9D43045A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410707004:1":{"text":"轮不到你怀疑！我相信我的眼睛！错不了，那可是赫托亲手用龙焰锻造的武器啊！","source_cn":"轮不到你怀疑！我相信我的眼睛！错不了，那可是赫托亲手用...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54305D097FA0EB4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410707005:1":{"text":"即便离得这么远，即便不懂魔法……我也能感受到它散发出来的魄力！","source_cn":"即便离得这么远，即便不懂魔法……我也能感受到它散发出来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9297ED11322E599B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_femal